[00:03.50]I've been living in and out of alcohol for so long now
{"长久以来我沉溺于酒精中浮沉"}
[00:07.50]That every time I try to wrestle with the truth, I'm lost on how
{"每当试图直面真相 却总迷失方向"}
[00:11.50]I'm a liar and then some, I'm a cheater at best
{"我是个骗子 甚至更糟 充其量是个背叛者"}
[00:15.50]I'm sick of this wet noose around my neck
{"厌倦了这绞索般湿漉漉的窒息感"}
[00:18.50]I'm going forwards, looking back
{"我向前迈进 却频频回首"}
[00:21.50]On everything I never had
{"凝望那些从未拥有过的所有"}
[00:23.50]Under the weight of all the qualities I lack
{"在自身缺失的品格重压下佝偻"}
[00:27.50]And I know it's time to change
{"我深知是时候做出改变"}
[00:29.20]It's time to finally act my age
{"是时候展现与年龄相称的体面"}
[00:31.50]Make amends with everyone I pushed away
{"向所有被我推开的人弥补亏欠"}
[00:35.00]Don't leave me on my own
{"别留我独自挣扎"}
[00:37.50]Until I'm fully grown
